    "summary": "2U 12-inch Short Depth Design Saves 38% Rack Space: With a depth of just 30.48 cm (12 inches), the short-depth NAS series can be easily deployed in shallow racks, edge storage environments, or space-constrained areas such as data centers, AV rooms, and surveillance control rooms, maximizing the utility of limited space. Ideal for Surveillance, AI Facial Recognition, and Edge Recording Applications: Equipped with high-capacity hard drives and iGPU video acceleration, ideal for deploying QNAP's QVR Surveillance Solution to centrally manage multiple camera feeds, run smart surveillance applications, and secure video footage. Redundant Power Supply for System Stability: The TS-h1065eU-RP features dual power supply redundancy, reducing the risk of power failure and enhancing business continuity by ensuring stable, uninterrupted service.",
