    "summary": "Samtec interconnect products support copper, optical, RF, and ruggedized applications. Popular products include Tiger Eye ™ high-cycle, high-reliability connector systems featuring Samtec’s most rugged contact system rated to 1,000+ mating cycles, with a variety of rugged options. FireFly ™ mid-board optical transceivers, with their micro footprint, enable greater density and closer proximity to the IC, thereby simplifying board layout, enhancing signal integrity, and reducing power dissipation. Samtec is a $1 billion global manufacturer of a broad line of electronic interconnect solutions, including High-Speed Board-to-Board, High-Speed Cables, Mid-Board and Panel Optics, Precision RF, Flexible Stacking, and Micro/Rugged components and cables.",
