    "publishedAt": "2026-11-25",
    "summary": "By combining cloud-scale computing with real-time factory-floor control, the new architecture helps manufacturers deploy AI and analytics faster while maintaining local control of time-critical workloads. The result is a more direct path from operational data to operational action, making Industrial Intelligence easier to deploy and scale across machines, lines and sites. The solution helps reduce the need for gateways, protocol converters and custom integration between industrial automation applications and AWS services. Existing systems retain deterministic control, time-critical processing remains on the factory floor, and manufacturers can progress machine by machine and site by site rather than replacing established control architectures all at once.",
