    "summary": "Data center being developed by Keppel Ltd KT Cloud has signed a 60MW lease with Keppel for its under-development data center in Ansan, within the greater Seoul Metropolitan Area in South Korea. The facility will have two basement floor levels and eight above-ground floors, spanning 52,620 sqm (566,420 sq ft) of floor space. The project demonstrates Keppel’s ability to bring together our investment, development and operating capabilities to create high-quality data center opportunities for our investors. By linking this data center with another existing data center as an integrated campus, we will support our customers’ infrastructure scaling in phases and continue to expand our data center business in line with actual customer needs.",
